  "risks": [
    "Paginated dependency reads must fail closed rather than authorize work from a partial set.",
    "Partial native mutation and projection failures must remain retryable without rolling back authoritative edges.",
    "Transient BLOCKED projection must never overwrite or clear a terminal Disposition.",
    "Legacy migration must remove the strict marker last so interruption remains recoverable."
